  "description": "Chatting game app where you can talk to strangers, act out situations, and create virtual families to form relationships. This simple game where you create an avatar and interact with others has become very popular in today's harsh society. Job seeker Han Jae-Woon also relieved his anxiety about the uncertain future through this community... And then he met his soulmate!? Is it okay to be attracted to someone you met in the community?\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
